{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model with multiprofile data using pca_n2000 RNA encoding and avgpool aggregation, comparing against the singleprofile baseline. The validation accuracy of 0.5907 (F1: 0.5727) suggests multiprofile settings may improve performance, though other factors like aggregation methods or RNA representations could also influence results. Uncertainty remains about the optimal configuration and the potential impact of multimodal components not evaluated here."
}

